<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>For Rashuu ❤️</title>

<style>

*{
box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
margin:0;
height:100vh;
overflow:hidden;
font-family:cursive;
background:
radial-gradient(circle,#fff5 2px,transparent 3px),
linear-gradient(135deg,#ff8fab,#ffc2d1,#ffe5ec);
background-size:40px 40px,cover;
text-align:center;
color:white;
}

.page{
position:absolute;
width:100%;
height:100%;
display:none;
padding:30px;
animation:flip 1s;
}

.active{
display:block;
}

@keyframes flip{
from{
transform:rotateY(90deg);
opacity:0;
}
to{
transform:rotateY(0);
opacity:1;
}
}


h1{
text-shadow:0 0 20px #ff006e;
}

.photo{
width:260px;
max-height:300px;
object-fit:cover;
border:10px solid white;
border-radius:20px;
animation:drop 1.5s;
box-shadow:0 0 30px #ff006e;
}


@keyframes drop{

0%{
transform:translateY(-500px) rotate(-20deg);
opacity:0;
}

80%{
transform:translateY(20px);
}

100%{
transform:translateY(0);
opacity:1;
}

}


.box{
background:#ffffff55;
padding:20px;
border-radius:25px;
font-size:20px;
margin-top:20px;
backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
}


button{

border:0;
padding:15px 35px;
border-radius:30px;
font-size:20px;
color:#ff4081;
background:white;

}


.gift{

font-size:120px;
animation:bounce 1s infinite;

}

@keyframes bounce{

50%{
transform:translateY(-25px);
}

}


video{

width:300px;
border-radius:20px;
box-shadow:0 0 30px white;

}


.flower{

position:absolute;
top:-50px;
animation:fall 6s linear;
font-size:25px;

}


@keyframes fall{

to{
top:110%;
transform:rotate(360deg);
}

}

</style>

</head>


<body>


<div class="page active">

<h1>Hey Beautiful Mommy 🥺😭</h1>

<h2>Rashuu shonaa... I made something for you ❤️</h2>

<button onclick="next()">Open 💌</button>

</div>



<div class="page">

<h1>A tiny world for my babe 🎁</h1>

<div class="gift" onclick="next()">🎁</div>

<h2>Tap the gift darlo ❤️</h2>

</div>




<div class="page">

<img src="photo1.jpg" class="photo">

<div class="box">

My Rashuu shonaa ❤️<br><br>

I don't know if this small website can show everything,
but I wanted to make something that belongs only to you.

Your little talks, your smile and your cute things
have a special place in my heart 🥺❤️

</div>

<button onclick="next()">Next 🌹</button>

</div>




<div class="page">

<img src="photo2.jpg" class="photo">

<div class="box">

Babe ❤️<br><br>

Sometimes it's not about expensive gifts or big things.

Small memories, random laughs and those tiny moments
are the things I want to keep forever with my Rashuu ✨

</div>

<button onclick="next()">Next 💎</button>

</div>




<div class="page">

<img src="photo3.jpg" class="photo">

<h1>🌹💍📿🍫</h1>

<div class="box">

For my darlo 💕

Flowers, earrings, Kashmiri bangles,
rings, pendants and chocolates...

You deserve every cute surprise in the world ❤️

</div>

<button onclick="next()">Memory 🎬</button>

</div>




<div class="page">

<h1>Our little memories 🎥❤️</h1>


<video controls>

<source src="video1.mp4">

</video>


<div class="box">

Some moments cannot be written,
they can only be felt ❤️

So I kept this memory here forever Rashuu 🥺

</div>


<button onclick="next()">Last 💌</button>

</div>




<div class="page">

<img src="photo4.jpg" class="photo">


<div class="box">

Happy Girlfriend's Day my Rashuu ❤️

Stay the same cute, special and amazing person.

I hope this made you smile,
because your smile was the reason I made it 🥺❤️

</div>

</div>




<script>


let p=document.querySelectorAll(".page");

let i=0;


function next(){

p[i].classList.remove("active");

i++;

p[i].classList.add("active");

}



setInterval(()=>{


let f=document.createElement("div");

f.className="flower";

f.innerHTML=["❤️","🌹","🌸","✨"][Math.floor(Math.random()*4)];

f.style.left=Math.random()*100+"%";

document.body.appendChild(f);

setTimeout(()=>f.remove(),6000);


},300);



</script>


</body>
</html>
